- B. sin(θ) = adjacent/hypotenuse => Q10_WRONG
- C. tan(θ) = opposite/hypotenuse => Q10_WRONG
- D. sec(θ) = 1/tan(θ) => Q10_WRONG

~ Q10_CORRECT
